1c:["$","section","What an in-house creative hire really costs",{"className":"mt-16 max-w-3xl","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-serif text-[clamp(22px,2.8vw,32px)] font-semibold","children":"What an in-house creative hire really costs"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-4 space-y-4 text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-[#A9A092]","children":[[["$","p","0",{"children":"The salary line is the smallest part of the lie. A social media manager, designer, or content person for a hotel typically posts at $50K–$90K, but the loaded cost is what hits the P&L:"}]],["$","ul",null,{"className":"list-disc space-y-2 pl-5 marker:text-[#C9A44C]","children":[["$","li","Salary plus benefits, insurance, and payroll taxes, typically +25–35% on top of base",{"children":"Salary plus benefits, insurance, and payroll taxes, typically +25–35% on top of base"}],["$","li","Software: design tools, stock libraries, scheduling platforms",{"children":"Software: design tools, stock libraries, scheduling platforms"}],["$","li","Recruiting costs and the 2–3 month vacancy before they start",{"children":"Recruiting costs and the 2–3 month vacancy before they start"}],["$","li","Management time, someone has to brief, review, and develop them",{"children":"Management time, someone has to brief, review, and develop them"}],["$","li","Replacement risk: when they leave, the content stops and the cycle restarts",{"children":"Replacement risk: when they leave, the content stops and the cycle restarts"}]]}]]}]]}]
1d:["$","section","All in: $90K–$180K a year",{"className":"mt-16 max-w-3xl","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-serif text-[clamp(22px,2.8vw,32px)] font-semibold","children":"All in: $90K–$180K a year"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-4 space-y-4 text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-[#A9A092]","children":[[["$","p","0",{"children":"Loaded, a dedicated creative hire lands between $90K and $180K annually depending on market and seniority. For a 120-room select-service property, that's a serious line item for a role that's hard to keep busy at senior quality every single week, and hard to keep, period: marketing roles at single properties have notoriously high turnover because good creatives outgrow them."}],["$","p","1",{"children":"The usual fallback is worse but hidden: the work lands on the GM, AGM, or sales manager. That looks free on the P&L, but you're paying a revenue-generating leader to fight with design software, and the output still looks like it."}]],"$undefined"]}]]}]
1e:["$","section","Agencies and freelancers: the middle options",{"className":"mt-16 max-w-3xl","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-serif text-[clamp(22px,2.8vw,32px)] font-semibold","children":"Agencies and freelancers: the middle options"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-4 space-y-4 text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-[#A9A092]","children":[[["$","p","0",{"children":"Hospitality marketing agencies do strong work, but their retainers are scoped for groups and resort brands, strategy, account management, and paid media bundled in whether you need it or not. Single properties routinely quote out at $3K–$10K+ a month before any production."}],["$","p","1",{"children":"Freelancers are the budget path, and they can work, until your regular is booked during your busiest season, or you spend hours re-briefing a new one on logo usage. Variable quality and zero continuity are the real costs that never show up in the hourly rate."}]],"$undefined"]}]]}]
1f:["$","section","The fixed-fee alternative",{"className":"mt-16 max-w-3xl","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-serif text-[clamp(22px,2.8vw,32px)] font-semibold","children":"The fixed-fee alternative"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-4 space-y-4 text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-[#A9A092]","children":[[["$","p","0",{"children":"Archer Design delivers the monthly output of a dedicated creative, social graphics, short-form video, captions, and campaign assets, approval-ready, for a flat monthly fee that lands well under the loaded cost of a hire. No benefits, no software stack, no recruiting, no vacancy gap, no replacement risk."}],["$","p","1",{"children":"Because we build from the photos and assets you already own, there's also no production budget hiding behind the fee. And for groups, one partnership covers multiple properties with consistent branding, the math gets better with each property added, not worse. Current tiers are on the packages page; the homepage has a calculator where you can run your own numbers."}]],"$undefined"]}]]}]
20:["$","section","Prove it before you pay for it",{"className":"mt-16 max-w-3xl","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-serif text-[clamp(22px,2.8vw,32px)] font-semibold","children":"Prove it before you pay for it"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-4 space-y-4 text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-[#A9A092]","children":[[["$","p","0",{"children":"Cost savings only matter if the quality holds, so we put the proof first: send your existing photos, a menu, or an event and get 5 finished assets back in 7 days, free. Compare them against what you're producing now, or what you imagined a hire would produce, then decide. If the quality doesn't make the decision easy, you've spent nothing and you keep the assets."}]],"$undefined"]}]]}]
21:["$","section",null,{"className":"mt-20 max-w-3xl","aria-label":"Frequently asked questions","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-[#C9A44C]","children":"FAQ"}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"mt-3 font-serif text-[clamp(24px,3vw,36px)] font-semibold","children":"Questions hotel teams actually ask."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-6 divide-y divide-[rgba(201,164,76,0.18)]","children":[["$","details","Where do the $90K–$180K numbers come from?",{"open":true,"className":"group py-5","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 font-serif text-lg text-[#F6F1E7] [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden","children":["Where do the $90K–$180K numbers come from?",["$","span",null,{"className":"text-2xl text-[#C9A44C] transition group-open:rotate-45","aria-hidden":true,"children":"+"}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-3 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-[#A9A092]","children":"Base salary ranges for marketing/creative roles plus standard loading: benefits, insurance, and payroll taxes (typically 25–35% on base), software, recruiting, and management time. Run your own market's numbers in the calculator on our homepage, the conclusion usually survives local adjustment."}]]}],["$","details","Is the monthly fee really fixed?",{"open":false,"className":"group py-5","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 font-serif text-lg text-[#F6F1E7] [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden","children":["Is the monthly fee really fixed?",["$","span",null,{"className":"text-2xl text-[#C9A44C] transition group-open:rotate-45","aria-hidden":true,"children":"+"}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-3 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-[#A9A092]","children":"Yes, each package is a flat monthly fee for a defined output level. If your needs grow (more properties, heavier seasons), you change tiers; nothing meters per asset behind your back."}]]}],["$","details","What's the catch versus an in-house hire?",{"open":false,"className":"group py-5","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 font-serif text-lg text-[#F6F1E7] [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden","children":["What's the catch versus an in-house hire?",["$","span",null,{"className":"text-2xl text-[#C9A44C] transition group-open:rotate-45","aria-hidden":true,"children":"+"}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-3 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-[#A9A092]","children":"An in-house person can walk the property daily and shoot spontaneously; we work from the assets your team sends. In practice clients find that trade easy, phone photos from staff plus our finishing covers it, but it's the honest difference."}]]}],["$","details","Do we have to commit to a long contract to get the savings?",{"open":false,"className":"group py-5","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 font-serif text-lg text-[#F6F1E7] [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden","children":["Do we have to commit to a long contract to get the savings?",["$","span",null,{"className":"text-2xl text-[#C9A44C] transition group-open:rotate-45","aria-hidden":true,"children":"+"}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-3 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-[#A9A092]","children":"No long lock-in is required to start. Begin with the free trial, then a monthly package, and ask us about commitment terms directly during the trial. Scale up, down, or pause as your season demands."}]]}],["$","details","Does this replace our whole marketing function?",{"open":false,"className":"group py-5","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 font-serif text-lg text-[#F6F1E7] [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden","children":["Does this replace our whole marketing function?","$L2c"]}],"$L2d"]}]]}]]}]
